flowchart LR
    Sample["BPF sample point<br/><b>does:</b> calls bpf_get_stackid for kernel/user stack<br/><b>why next:</b> hot path should store compact IDs, not symbolize<br/><b>state:</b> stack map has frame array; stackid returned"]
    Hist["histogram map<br/><b>does:</b> increments count for stackid or stackid pair<br/><b>why next:</b> userspace can aggregate without per-event flood<br/><b>state:</b> stackid -> count"]
    Read["userspace snapshot<br/><b>does:</b> reads histogram and stack maps<br/><b>why next:</b> symbols live outside BPF verifier/kernel fast path<br/><b>state:</b> raw IP arrays plus counts"]
    Sym["symbolization<br/><b>does:</b> maps kernel IPs via kallsyms and user IPs via PID maps/ELF<br/><b>why next:</b> flamegraph needs function names and folded stacks<br/><b>state:</b> named call chains"]
    Fold["folded stacks<br/><b>does:</b> formats 'a;b;c count' lines<br/><b>why next:</b> flamegraph renderer consumes folded input<br/><b>state:</b> weighted stack strings"]
    Render["flamegraph / speedscope<br/><b>does:</b> turns weights into visual width<br/><b>state:</b> wide frames show where time accumulated"]

    Sample --> Hist --> Read --> Sym --> Fold --> Render

    classDef bpf fill:#dbeafe,stroke:#2563eb
    classDef user fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#16a34a
    classDef out fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#d97706
    class Sample,Hist bpf
    class Read,Sym,Fold user
    class Render out
